\v 11 \zwd Joram|id="Q313215" t="2"\zwd* \f + \fr 3:11 \ft Joram is a variant spelling of Jehoram.\f* his son, \zwd Ahaziah|id="Q313214" t="2"\zwd* his son, \zwd Joash|id="Q313229" t="2"\zwd* his son, 
